							<div align="center"><font color="#0000ff"><b>Druid Epic</b></font><br /> </div> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr><td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods - Hail Telin Darkforest and say "What action should I take?" - Receive a Worn Note</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Greater Faydark - Give the Worn Note to Faelin Bloodbriar - Receive Faelin's Ring (PH is an orc pawn around +1500, +500)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kithicor Forest - Give Faelin's Ring to Giz X'Tin - A Dark Reaver will spawn, just run to the zone. Receive a Dark Metal Coin.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods - Give the Dark Metal Coin to Telin Darkforest- Receive the Worn Dark Metal Coin.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">East Karana - All steps must be done to Completion - Give the Worn Dark Metal Coin to Althele - Receive Braided Grass Amulet. Give this amulet to Sionae - Receive Frayed Braided Grass Amulet. Give this amulet to Nuien - Receive the amulet back. Give this amulet to Teloa. This will cause a Dark Elf Corruptor and two Dark Reavers to spawn. Kill DE Corruptor while trying to protect the druids - Loot Fleshbound Tomb.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">East Karana - Give Fleshbound Tomb to Althele to recive Earth Stained Note. Althele will despawn after receiving tomb. *NOTE: If druids die you will have to wait 30 min. for her to respawn - this is true if you need to complete the cycle more than once.*</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <br /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shiny Tin Bowl 7</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Misty Thicket - Give the Earth Stained Note to Ella Foodcrafter - Receive Shiny Tin Bowl.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Hardened Mixture 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Everfrost - Forage Chilled Tundra Root</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Hardened Mixture 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Misty Thicket - Forage Sweetened Mudroot</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Hardened Mixture 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Innothule Swamp - Forage Speckled Mushroom</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Hardened Mixture 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Greater Faydark - Forage Ripened Heartfruit</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Hardened Mixture 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Combine the chilled tundra root, sweetened mudroot, speckled mushroom and ripened heartfruit in the Shiny Tin Bowl to create the Hardened Mixture.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ancient Bowl Pattern 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Timorous Deep - Hail Alrik Farsight on Chessboard Island and say "I will take the artifact" - Receive a Crushed Pot</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ancient Bowl Pattern 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Felwithe South - Give Crushed Pot to Farios Elianos - Receive a grocery list</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ancient Bowl Pattern 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Felwithe North - Give Grocery List to Merchant Nora - Receive a Bag of Provisions.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ancient Bowl Pattern 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Felwith South/North - Give Bag of Provision to Farios Elianos - Receive Receipt for the Ancient Bowl</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ancient Bowl Pattern 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Timorous Deep - Give the receipt to Alrik Farsight - Receive an Ancient Pattern</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <br /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Platinum Speckled Powder 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie - Forage a Rose of Firiona</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <br /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Platinum Speckled Powder 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Surefall Glade - Give the rose to Merdan Fleetfoot - Receive a Wood Painting</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Platinum Speckled Powder 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Frontier Mountains - Give the wood Painting to a Human Skeleton (Spawns around -2100, +2000) Receive a Silver Chained Locket.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Platinum Speckled Powder 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Surefall Glade - Give the Silver Chained Locket to Niera Farbreeze - Receive the Platinum Speckled Powder.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Rune Crested Bowl 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">City of Mist - Kill a Black Reaver and loot a Jade Reaver (this item is tradeable)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Rune Crested Bowl 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">North Kaladim - Give the Jade Reaver to Kinlo Strongarm in Everhot Forge - Receive Enchanted Clay</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Create the Rune Crested Bowl 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Combine the Ancient Bowl Pattern, Enchanted Clay and Platinum Speckled Powder in any pottery wheel to make the Rune Crested Bowl (no pottery skill needed.)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Glowing Stones 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Misty Thicket - Give the Hardened Mixture and the Rune Crested bowl to Ella Foodcrafter - Receive a Softly Glowing Stone</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Glowing Stones 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Karnor's Castle - Kill Venril Sathir to get Venril Sathir's Remains to spawn. Casst the spell Dance of the Fireflies to summon a Firefly Globe. Give Venril Sathir's Remains the Firefly Globe to spawn the Spirit of Venril Sathir. Give the Spirit of Venril Sathir the Level 49 Cleric Resurrection spell to respawn Venril Sathir. Kill Venril Sathir and loot the Pulsing Green Stone.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Glowing Stones 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie - Give the Softly Glowing Stone and the Pulsing Green Stone to Foloal Stormforest - Receive a Warmly Glowing Stone.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Glowing Stones 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Misty Thicket - Give the Warmly Glowing Stone to Ella Foodcrafter - Receive the Elaborate Scimitar</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Antonica 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Everfrost Peaks - Find and kill Tained Mammoths until a Corrupted Mammoth spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Mammoth and loot a Chunk of Tundra.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Antonica 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lake Rathetear - Find and kill Tainted Aquagoblin Shamans until a Corrupted Aquagoblin Shaman spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Aquagoblin Shaman and loot Clean Lakewater</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Antonica 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Rathe Mountains - Find and kill Tainted Hill Giants until a Corrupted Hill Giant spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Hill Giant and loot an Ancient Rock</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Antonica 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">North Karana - Give the Chunk of Tundra, Clean Lakewater and Ancient Rock to the Withered Treant - Receive the Warm Pulsing Treant Heart</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Antonica 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">South Karana - Give the Warm Pulsing Treant Heart to Yeka Ias - Receive the Cleansed Spirit of Antonica</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kedge Keep - Find and kill Tainted Seahorses until a Corrupted Seahorse spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Seahorse and loot Kedge Cave Crystal</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ocean of Tears - Find and kill Tainted Cyclops until a Corrupted Cyclops spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Cyclops and loot Ocean of Tears Seavines.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lesser Faydark - Find and kill Tainted Brownies until a Corrupted Brownie spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Brownie and loot a Green Heartwood Branch</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lesser Faydark - Give the Kedge Cave Crystal, Ocean of Tears Seavines and green Heartwood Branch to the Pained Unicorn - Receive Gleaming Unicorn Horn</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Ak'Anon - Give the Gleaming Unicorn Horn to Silox Azrix - Receive the Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Kunark 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Swamp of No Hope - Find Ulump Pujik near the froglok village (-100, -1770). Kill him and loot Froglok Essence.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Kunark 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Emerald Jungle - Find and kill "Live" Tainted Gorillas until a Corrupted Gorilla spawns in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Gorilla and loot Green Tree Bark.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Kunark 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lake of Ill Omen - Find and kill Deepwater Barracuda to spawn a "blue" Tainted Barracuda. Kill the Tainted Barracude to make a Corrupted Barracuda spawn in it's place. Kill the Corrupted Barracuda and loot Pure Lakewater.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Kunark 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Timorous Deep - Give Dolgin Codslaye (-11300, -400, 5 hour spawn) the Froglok Essence to spawn the mighty Dragon Faydedar. When you hand the essence to Dolgin he will despawn and give you the Froglok Essence back. Faydedar should come out of the water immediately. Kill him and loot a Pod of Seawater.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Cleansed Spirit of Kunark 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Overthere - Give the Froglok Essence, Green Tree Bark, Pure Lakewater and Pod of Seawater to Nekexin Virulence (east of the evil outpost near the water) - Receive the Cleansed Spirit of Kunark</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Nature Walker's Scimitar</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">North Karana - Give the Cleansed Spirit of Antonica, Cleansed Spirit of Faydwer, Cleansed Spirit of Kunark, and the Elaborate Scimitar to Xanuusus the treant - Receive NATURE WALKER'S SCIMITAR!</td></tr></tbody> </table> <br /> 
							
